OL,3,GNEWSABurnham caught in north-south
OL,4,Asatellite deal battle
OL,5,
OL,6,FBritain is about to decide who should
OL,7,Fbuild a new generation of military
OL,8,Fsatellites that will be vital for our
OL,9,Farmed forces in any future war.
OL,11,FBut the contest between the two
OL,12,Fremaining rival bidders seems to have
OL,13,Fembroiled Andy Burnham's government in
OL,14,Fa home-grown north-south conflict about
OL,15,Fwhere the jobs and investment should
OL,16,Fgo.
OL,18,FAnd MPs and local political leaders in
OL,19,Fnorth-east England see it as a test
OL,20,Fabout just how serious the prime
OL,21,Fminister is about meeting his goal of
OL,22,F"growth in every postcode".
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
