OL,3,GNEWSABurnham caught in north-south
OL,4,Asatellite deal battle
OL,5,
OL,6,FLockheed Martin wants to bring the work
OL,7,Fon the government's Skynet 6 programme
OL,8,Fto a new #85m factory in County Durham
OL,9,F- and the site at NetPark in Sedgefield
OL,10,Fis in an area which certainly needs the
OL,11,F500 jobs being promised.
